OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty homes tax could be
OL,4,Aintroduced, says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn empty property tax could be
OL,7,Fintroduced on the Isle of Man, the new
OL,8,Fhousing minister has said.
OL,10,FRob Callister, who was appointed to the
OL,11,Fnewly created role in the Council of
OL,12,FMinisters on Friday, said he would look
OL,13,Fat a levy on empty and dilapidated
OL,14,Fhomes "similar to what they have in
OL,15,FEngland".
OL,17,FThe Onchan MHK also said he wanted to
OL,18,Fbring forward a national housing plan
OL,19,Fwithin the next 12 months "if not
OL,20,Fsooner".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
